6851654,2023-04-17,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"To Whom It May Concern, I am writing this letter to express concerns about your organization 's apparent violation of my rights under local and state. This correspondence serves as a final notice and a clear and unequivocal warning that legal action will be pursued should your organization continue to violate my rights willfully and negligently. 

