6873538,2023-04-21,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Struggling to pay your loan,Lender trying to repossess or disable the vehicle,"On XX/XX/XXXX I was told by a manager at Nissan Finance that because of my hardship of being hit and run by a semi tanker truck on XX/XX/XXXX and being injured and losing my income, that Nissan Finance  would move 2 payments to the back of the loan, if I could somehow make one payment that day of {$550.00}. I did my best get a payment and expected Nissan Finance to honor their word to move 2 payments to the back of the loan so that I could bring the loan up to date. 

